<!doctype lake><title>🦫 𝓡𝓮𝓯𝓲𝓷𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="yDwJO" id="yDwJO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u98992b2e" id="u98992b2e">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u39c1b50c" id="u39c1b50c"> 𝐒𝐨𝐟𝐭 𝐀𝐝𝐚𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u958a7820" id="u958a7820"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdc03a47" id="ucdc03a47">在各类强化学习方法中，基于组的策略优化已成为一种切实可行的训练方案：针对每个查询采样多个响应，在组内对序列级奖励进行归一化，并利用当前策略与行为策略之间的重要性比率对策略更新进行加权</span></strong></p><ul list="u4b67ca12"><li fid="u3c9dc8c6" data-lake-id="u00f7acfa" id="u00f7acfa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d4d5460" id="u1d4d5460" style="color: #5C0036">这一训练范式面临的核心挑战是 token 级重要性比率的高方差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf13764a5" id="uf13764a5">，尤其是在混合专家模型中，路由异质性与较长的响应可能进一步放大 token 间的偏差。这种高方差会增加更新不稳定的风险</span></li><li fid="u3c9dc8c6" data-lake-id="ubf1fabaa" id="ubf1fabaa"><span data-lake-id="u4a7e21ca" id="u4a7e21ca">GRPO 采用的硬裁剪机制通过将固定区间之外的梯度置零来限制较大的偏离。尽管硬裁剪能够有效抑制过大的更新步幅，但它难以在稳定性与有效学习之间取得理想的权衡：过于严格的裁剪会限制可用于梯度计算的有效样本数量，而较为宽松的裁剪则会引入来自离策略样本的噪声梯度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0f2fb785" id="u0f2fb785"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c0873d1" id="u1c0873d1">为解决基于组的策略优化中硬裁剪机制的脆弱性，提出软自适应策略优化</span></strong></p><ul list="uce6cfc95"><li fid="u6a90a88f" data-lake-id="u461d3f6c" id="u461d3f6c"><span data-lake-id="ub3f0c9b5" id="ub3f0c9b5">一种平滑且具有自适应能力的策略梯度方法，使用温度控制的软门控替代硬裁剪。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ueba5ca4b" id="ueba5ca4b" style="color: #00346B">SAPO 使用一个以重要性比率为输入、以同策略点为中心的有界 S 形函数，对 token 级更新进行加权。由此形成一个连续的信赖域</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4c0da529" id="u4c0da529">：在接近同策略状态时，保留梯度以鼓励有效更新与探索；随着比率逐渐偏离，梯度被平滑衰减而非直接截断，从而在减少优化噪声的同时，保留中等程度偏离所对应的学习信号</span></li><li fid="u6a90a88f" data-lake-id="u40321471" id="u40321471"><span data-lake-id="ua89988c7" id="ua89988c7">为进一步增强大词表场景下的鲁棒性，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u76a549e9" id="u76a549e9" style="color: #70000D">SAPO 对正、负优势 token 采用非对称温度，使负优势 token 的梯度衰减得更快</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc8a5ab30" id="uc8a5ab30">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud60dd1b9" id="ud60dd1b9" style="color: #004347">这一设计反映两类更新在稳定性方面的差异：负向更新往往会提高许多不合适 token 的 logits，因此比正向更新更容易引入不稳定性</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubc1d5e5a" id="ubc1d5e5a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7a7e630" id="ue7a7e630">从概念上看，SAPO 旨在兼具序列级一致性与 token 级自适应性</span></strong></p><ul list="uf492c179"><li fid="uc16f1455" data-lake-id="u29234803" id="u29234803"><span data-lake-id="u9b973fbf" id="u9b973fbf">在温和且实践中常见的条件下，即同策略更新步长较小、序列内 token 对数比率的离散程度较低时，token 级门控的平均值会集中于一个平滑的序列级门控，从而使优化过程与序列级奖励保持一致，这与 GSPO 等基于序列的方法具有相同的基本思路</span></li><li fid="uc16f1455" data-lake-id="u6278cb01" id="u6278cb01"><strong><span data-lake-id="u748ce628" id="u748ce628" style="color: #5C0036">当 token 的异质性或异常 token 导致上述条件不再成立时，SAPO 会选择性地降低这些 token 的权重，同时保留同一序列中接近同策略状态的 token 所提供的有效梯度。这种选择性衰减能够减轻硬裁剪造成的信号损失，在保持更新稳定的同时提高采样效率</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="oAKGW" id="oAKGW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua510c35e" id="ua510c35e"> </span><span data-lake-id="u696d0f5b" id="u696d0f5b">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u3d1b26c4" id="u3d1b26c4"> 𝐒𝐨𝐟𝐭 𝐀𝐝𝐚𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud04bdff7" id="ud04bdff7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf16c2814" id="uf16c2814">软自适应策略优化是一种用于强化学习微调的平滑、自适应策略梯度方法，通过温度控制的软门控替代硬裁剪</span></strong></p><ul list="u5ba1f74b"><li fid="u41226094" data-lake-id="ua527587e" id="ua527587e"><span data-lake-id="u3e628ec1" id="u3e628ec1">传统强化学习研究中已有对平滑门控函数的探索。在 SAPO 中，将这一思想引入面向大语言模型的基于组的强化学习范式，并在此基础上加入两个对大规模语言模型训练至关重要的组成部分：能够自然形成序列级一致性的 token 级软信赖域；基于正、负优势 token 更新行为差异的非对称温度设计</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u69f70bab" id="u69f70bab" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Df_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76bb0f13249ae871dfa596fc175f1f26.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BME2D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7eeaf8d2" id="u7eeaf8d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(x)%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(x-1)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3E0%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2959f2975deb98a95ed129cb35e67599.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22THIl0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0c60ed0b" id="u0c60ed0b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dw_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5C%2Cr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbb2d6e3b20852fce5d297218a4e0e62.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z1cuO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9610ddc7" id="u9610ddc7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D4%5C%5C%2Cp_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cleft(1-p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86a67e9a4968e3d4a3ad464a7d99e4b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q1q3y%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u92ad8806"><li fid="u0a044a7f" data-lake-id="uafb8c731" id="uafb8c731"><span data-lake-id="uc47ee0bf" id="uc47ee0bf">权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dfbb2538d3ba951541028f33bcaecb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R3uJh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c9e42b8" id="u6c9e42b8">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W3dzI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc60cd91a" id="uc60cd91a">时达到峰值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZND2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ef758b1" id="u1ef758b1">，并随着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4323480e5da85abf6a01751172ceb51c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DzzyL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b34b416" id="u6b34b416">偏离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22daLhc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d26d117" id="u9d26d117">而以近似指数的形式平滑衰减，从而形成软信赖域，同时防止梯度消失和过大的更新。特别地，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tpjkj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc56ad36" id="ubc56ad36">时，无论</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0660784ae953829ecc20c4e1eb836f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lExH3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70cf31a0" id="u70cf31a0">取何值，软门控下的梯度均与未裁剪目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6632c9d8637a995c844d0dc118468ea4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rf4n5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2a2a56a" id="ub2a2a56a">的梯度相同，从而保持同策略更新行为。这也解释为何在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ylaOM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ec57b2f" id="u6ec57b2f">中引入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%224%2F%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca6b5f61eccb45e7eb0a029ae8e4b2b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vU6Ls%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1fd50885" id="u1fd50885">这一因子</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa82bc99" id="uaa82bc99" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790760758240-a58ee73d-c42f-4d3c-9f94-774186a0f8f8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6815b3bc-b30b-4e42-abfe-f73b9439cc8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uafdb6e2d-b46f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A759%2C%22height%22%3A245%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A98782%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1521%2C%22originHeight%22%3A490%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%8E%B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A237%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTGATE(T%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A712%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTGATE(T%3D3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1227%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTGATE(T%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A966%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNCLIPPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A190%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARDCLIR%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RI.C(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%801.(%22%2C%22x%22%3A540%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A765%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RIC(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1132%2C%22y%22%3A444%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PING%22%2C%22x%22%3A466%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%890%22%2C%22x%22%3A761%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A784%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A762%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(8%E4%B8%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafaf9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u205275bb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u53075e9a" id="u53075e9a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9536b35f" id="u9536b35f">与 GSPO 和 GRPO 相比，SAPO 兼具序列级一致性与 token 级自适应性</span></strong></p><ul list="ue5af7bc4"><li fid="u8d88e31c" data-lake-id="uf72d0898" id="uf72d0898"><span data-lake-id="u381c86c5" id="u381c86c5">在温和的假设下，即同策略更新步长较小、序列内 token 对数比率的离散程度较低时，token 级门控的平均值会集中于一个平滑的序列级门控 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D_i%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe43ccfa9877357dccee58d1dd0e0c3d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YYiuc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5347ea1b" id="u5347ea1b">。因此，SAPO 可归约为类似 GSPO 的序列级形式，但具有连续的信赖域</span></li><li fid="u8d88e31c" data-lake-id="u958e1790" id="u958e1790"><span data-lake-id="ucc8b9f61" id="ucc8b9f61">关键在于，当少数离策略 token 将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99fef66755b65b72ae46f4fdc159c96e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o2qbi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e276145" id="u6e276145">推至 GSPO 的硬裁剪区间之外时，GSPO 会同时抑制该序列中大量接近同策略状态的 token 的梯度，从而降低样本效率。相比之下，SAPO 仅降低引起偏离的 token 的权重，同时使接近同策略状态的 token 继续发挥作用，从而保留有效梯度</span></li><li fid="u8d88e31c" data-lake-id="u8429d1f8" id="u8429d1f8"><span data-lake-id="u9d801d0f" id="u9d801d0f">相较于 GRPO，SAPO 避免将固定区间之外的梯度置零的 token 级硬裁剪，而是对更新进行平滑缩放，从而在保留有效学习信号与防止不稳定的策略偏移之间取得更好的平衡</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue9804f0e" id="ue9804f0e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a398b99" id="u1a398b99">超参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EngZ0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c0dc6de" id="u6c0dc6de">控制衰减速率：其取值越大，衰减越快。尽管负优势 token 对探索和防止过拟合至关重要，但它们通常比正优势 token 引入更强的不稳定性</span></strong></p><ul list="ue30e38bc"><li fid="u0737d0f6" data-lake-id="ua9c9a471" id="ua9c9a471"><span data-lake-id="u2cd1fbf1" id="u2cd1fbf1">通过分析 token 级梯度如何经由 logits 传播来论证这一点。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%3D%5Bz_1%2Cz_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cz_%7B%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7C%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e43b32aeaf0721d2babb2c5d59a56c9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kx15h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0dbbeccd" id="u0dbbeccd">表示 logits，其中词表大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07c5394e99eda4e260ef48f64d671e6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fqs1H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u962dae08" id="u962dae08">；令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tnQUZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a30e7fe" id="u4a30e7fe">表示一个 token，并通过 softmax 运算计算输出概率，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(v%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%3D%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%2F%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%7D%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75efad29ea6fb93d464ac3d037fffea8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FiQAE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04922465" id="u04922465">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue1ecd48e" id="ue1ecd48e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D(v%3Dy_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D)-%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%7D%7B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5E2%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(1-%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7Dv%3Dy_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(sampled%20token)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn-%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(v%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(unsampled%20token)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-2pt%5D%5Cn(9)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F575b8addeb6bd88f537bcaaf4b4501ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A853H%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u50ce4c75"><li fid="u9dee2ece" data-lake-id="u1148253d" id="u1148253d"><span data-lake-id="u1103209a" id="u1103209a">正优势会提高被采样 token 的 logit，并降低所有未被采样 token 的 logits；负优势的作用则相反，会提高大量未被采样 token 的 logits</span></li><li fid="u9dee2ece" data-lake-id="u493fe9ec" id="u493fe9ec"><strong><span data-lake-id="u395d72a1" id="u395d72a1" style="color: #DF2A3F">大语言模型的强化学习微调中，动作空间是一个庞大的词表，通常包含数十万个 token，而给定状态下理想动作的数量却很少。因此，负向梯度会扩散至大量无关 token，虽然能够提供一定的正则化作用，但也会引发不稳定性，尤其是在离策略场景下</span></strong></li><li fid="u9dee2ece" data-lake-id="u6f64f6f3" id="u6f64f6f3"><span data-lake-id="uded3a829" id="uded3a829">基于这一考虑，对正、负优势 token 使用不同的温度，并设置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bneg%7D%7D%3E%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpos%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5f6ab6f9d64e46f291515e1de0117d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LVsxt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac2bd7f3" id="uac2bd7f3">，使负优势 token 的梯度衰减得更快，从而提高训练稳定性与性能</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="LwSKf" id="LwSKf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u01f30fea" id="u01f30fea">🍎</span><span data-lake-id="uafbed7b0" id="uafbed7b0"> 𝐀 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠-𝐅𝐮𝐧𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐨𝐧 𝐒𝐀𝐏𝐎’𝐬 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬 𝐭𝐨 𝐆𝐑𝐏𝐎 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐆𝐒𝐏𝐎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uefd7a9b7" id="uefd7a9b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc58c1bf8" id="uc58c1bf8">统一的代理目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubd60bdbc" id="ubd60bdbc">：考虑如下形式的统一代理目标</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue4c426b2" id="ue4c426b2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Df_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cbig(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ad62c026c1177df13dbc6fb0eeb2a7e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PDyst%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5eacf49c"><li fid="u1592b822" data-lake-id="uaad029d7" id="uaad029d7"><span data-lake-id="u0761fda7" id="u0761fda7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c8085c4c4c53958fe2b374e7d5400cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S3ZHd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8594cea" id="uc8594cea">是由具体算法决定的门控函数。进一步将经过长度归一化的序列级比率定义为 token 级比率的几何平均</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u07e7a907" id="u07e7a907" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cexp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsg%7D%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa56883a674a381914fa5b85e390884ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wFh0U%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf194c48c" id="uf194c48c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52f574fc" id="u52f574fc">不同算法的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NfO2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u123d1da3" id="u123d1da3">：各算法的区别在于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCqpm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43b970f0" id="u43b970f0">的选择</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5ea61428" id="u5ea61428" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%3A%7D%5C%5Cquad%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Ctau_i(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cbig)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_i%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%3E0%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cleq%200%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4a07839bc6842d284fd688c4b03867a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oRF1K%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9a4109d4" id="u9a4109d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%3A%7D%5C%5Cquad%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cbig(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%5C%5C%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cbig)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%3E0%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cbig(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%5C%5C%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cbig)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cleq%200%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F382b1e4de858d2d0d97708baff0e894d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FAXYx%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ueff61c6b" id="ueff61c6b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%3A%7D%5C%5Cquad%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGSPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%5C%5Cequiv%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bseq%7D%7D%5C%5Cbig(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cbig)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cbig(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%5C%5C%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cbig)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%3E0%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cbig(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%5C%5C%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cbig)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cleq%200.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d97a6464490bb3531c7543b966d8108.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zL3VC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0951a86f"><li fid="u1e43c108" data-lake-id="u4d0402f5" id="u4d0402f5"><span data-lake-id="ucd7f3425" id="ucd7f3425">GSPO 的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MbANJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17985aee" id="u17985aee">在同一序列内不随 token 变化，而 SAPO 和 GRPO 的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EAAmG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc64fc0be" id="uc64fc0be">则依赖于具体 token</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2fa3125f" id="u2fa3125f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd9d1ab0" id="ufd9d1ab0">SAPO/GRPO 的梯度形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1994b296" id="u1994b296">　对式（10）求导，并利用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb49df5e9e6243a40f5de63b91c8fc544.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xm7ea%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ec0e25d" id="u6ec0e25d">，可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3ba23fb6" id="u3ba23fb6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Df_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cbig(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2Cr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37b1de46508a282a987f5d487ccec7f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IQLVJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc4facc47" id="uc4facc47"><span data-lake-id="u9202baa8" id="u9202baa8">在温和的条件下，SAPO 可归约为类似 GSPO 的序列级形式，同时在具有异质性的序列中保留 token 级自适应性</span></p><ul list="u9e918ae9"><li fid="ub59a007b" data-lake-id="u95e0923e" id="u95e0923e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf223ab3b" id="uf223ab3b">SAPO 的 token 级软门控：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf829325a" id="uf829325a">利用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(x)(1-%5C%5Csigma(x))%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B(e%5E%7Bx%2F2%7D%2Be%5E%7B-x%2F2%7D)%5E2%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(x%2F2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa93b8b095d71a2eb2bd88a60c8eef77f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yZZBX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6dda69e9" id="u6dda69e9">，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e58c632" id="u0e58c632" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cprime%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D4%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Ctau_i(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5CBig(1-%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Ctau_i(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5CBig)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e662d94ddbd058ed90e50f3d2fb8ef8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dX5t4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5d4dc643" id="u5d4dc643"><span data-lake-id="u0015c8b2" id="u0015c8b2">采用以下两个常见假设</span></p><ul list="u5671ff14"><li fid="ub4e06d5c" data-lake-id="u70084e6c" id="u70084e6c"><span data-lake-id="u1ed6ac2c" id="u1ed6ac2c">小步长：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3978485e598dcf1f6cece33ee8dd819.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lmUXL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d4067dd" id="u4d4067dd">。因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Capprox%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73625c0a587031388157f90b09e9e478.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZNs3z%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ub4e06d5c" data-lake-id="u82425cb2" id="u82425cb2"><span data-lake-id="ubad194c5" id="ubad194c5">序列内离散程度较低：令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F827631062e7bd15e710bec1c3927cdb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vqvi1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u451a6ece" id="u451a6ece">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_t%20z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47fe184c9d5edec8cddf2ace721501ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S3Mf4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e4fef5c" id="u4e4fef5c">，则对大多数序列而言，方差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3A%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_t(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d8fee21c35080d9e588731d50ef966d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zt3la%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7018412" id="ue7018412"> 较小</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e34b499" id="u0e34b499"><span data-lake-id="u1b78ed37" id="u1b78ed37">在假设 (A1) 下，有：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1e18349b" id="u1e18349b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cprime%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%3D%3Ag_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5Cbig(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad501564159a8a33ed2e515ef15ceca8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WC3qF%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufe61298e" id="ufe61298e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf7132dcb" id="uf7132dcb">平均 token 门控 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CRightarrow%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7e62ff1f9ebb4d97584ede054a0dca9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JwDMZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u60155441" id="u60155441"> 序列门控</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u000c069e" id="u000c069e">：将平滑函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B2%7Dz)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea09f7040e39777e6dd1376e7ec288b7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OkXNz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u176ba154" id="u176ba154"> 在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52b28c3656f0c2bab251e8332a60b813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22su9r2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9208678" id="ub9208678"> 处作二阶泰勒展开，可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0a9b15b6" id="u0a9b15b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%2Bg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5C%2C(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5C%2Cg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%5C%5Cprime%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5C%2C(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbed04b003f0332c03b791d580c6bd5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xXZbF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u75b9cf1b"><li fid="u465f6685" data-lake-id="u9ce7f04a" id="u9ce7f04a"><span data-lake-id="u904e6f7a" id="u904e6f7a">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff602bfb77c7ac7b5055c8d2e0114ce98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cjXHF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66791d7d" id="u66791d7d"> 位于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F802b10177b5452ae182f5083e83a031b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GxjlI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u45956313" id="u45956313"> 与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F046ae87323d03a070a9d750f0d1ce898.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lKWM8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf4807878" id="uf4807878"> 之间。对各 token 取平均后，线性项相消</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5b81ea67" id="u5b81ea67" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%5C%5Cprime%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5C%2C(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5be99cc79aaf6db4e822a517eeab648.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Njszq%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u89bec5b8"><li fid="u49c3ab76" data-lake-id="ub8de497e" id="ub8de497e"><span data-lake-id="ue3c94f6f" id="ue3c94f6f">对于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcddfa6344f36165677f65cb33810093f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ablab%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7195a5cd" id="u7195a5cd">，其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23bac5bc54ecb61c0d1c1045439e2797.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gInTB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c362e97" id="u0c362e97">，直接计算可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u98fad934" id="u98fad934" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%5C%5Cprime%7D(z)%3D%5C%5Calpha%5E2%5C%5CBig(4%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(%5C%5Calpha%20z)-6%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B4%7D(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%5C%5CBig)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csup_z%7Cg_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%5C%5Cprime%7D(z)%7C%3D2%5C%5Calpha%5E2%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau%5E2%7D%7B2%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc94c13b50fc624faa3880014e0b3effd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eYPVm%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u10dce113"><li fid="u6475c8eb" data-lake-id="u16d82a51" id="u16d82a51"><span data-lake-id="u0269b7a1" id="u0269b7a1">因此，平均 token 门控可以由序列门控较好地近似，并满足如下统一误差界</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u02d84d7c" id="u02d84d7c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_t%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))-g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5Cright%7C%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Csup_z%7Cg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%5C%5Cprime%7D(z)%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%5E2%7D%7B4%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F199be4ca23ee92198d524368522c7a77.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dtQ9x%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ued419bdf"><li fid="ud06f0507" data-lake-id="u6e668290" id="u6e668290"><span data-lake-id="u320076a0" id="u320076a0">从式（15）出发，并应用假设 (A1) 中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3978485e598dcf1f6cece33ee8dd819.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dz91H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3fdffc3c" id="u3fdffc3c">，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u505ad00c" id="u505ad00c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%7D%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0fccb6cb03569804bd55c471187ab8d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k0tyG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u21e299f2" id="u21e299f2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Dg_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F729e632dcf2b1cbf3e6f3953b67475ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UJDmk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4d314eb7"><li fid="u22b84bbc" data-lake-id="udecf6958" id="udecf6958"><span data-lake-id="ucd69e726" id="ucd69e726">因此，在假设 (A1)–(A2) 下，SAPO 可归约为在结构上类似 GSPO 的序列级更新，其平滑门控为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe39e4104a582bfc91cd96e697e3ec7da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fzEeH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u394fd92f" id="u394fd92f">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u099ba64f" id="u099ba64f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac76ba26" id="uac76ba26">GRPO 的分段硬 token 门控</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4d6ff508" id="u4d6ff508">：对于 GRPO，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a4690bba7866021e8ff285e691758db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XHVJc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0b38261" id="ub0b38261">相对于裁剪区间呈分段常数形式。求导可得</span></p><p data-lake-id="u44387d44" id="u44387d44" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cprime%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn1%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%3E0%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cleq%201%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%3E0%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3E1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn1%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cleq%200%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cgeq%201-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cleq%200%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7Dr_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60f93b96151f58c7a090686d64254f3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jaSXk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u93c8701d"><li fid="u147dfe3d" data-lake-id="u3d86ba44" id="u3d86ba44"><span data-lake-id="u2f2a935b" id="u2f2a935b">因此，GRPO 采用一个二值信赖域：位于域内的 token 获得与未裁剪目标相同的梯度，而位于域外的 token 的梯度为零</span></li><li fid="u147dfe3d" data-lake-id="u0ecce2ed" id="u0ecce2ed"><span data-lake-id="u8eae4123" id="u8eae4123">与 GRPO 相比，SAPO 使用平滑核函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSAPO%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cprime%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E%7B2%7D(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)-1))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14add6e1840e6f9f9501005e3e4bfe3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KO31G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71544261" id="u71544261">替代式中的硬指示函数，从而避免梯度消失，并使更新过程更加稳定。当策略比率的变化较小时，梯度保持较强的响应能力，允许较大的参数更新；随着偏离程度增大，梯度平滑收缩，从而使调整更加保守</span></li><li fid="u147dfe3d" data-lake-id="u34938554" id="u34938554"><span data-lake-id="u81687e00" id="u81687e00">相比之下，GRPO 的 token 级硬裁剪形成一种全有或全无的门控，往往导致脆弱且不稳定的优化行为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u936b2bf7" id="u936b2bf7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc364cf63" id="uc364cf63" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">强化学习算法的主要区别在于如何处理</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4323480e5da85abf6a01751172ceb51c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EyvEc%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e4b3ee4" id="u7e4b3ee4" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">偏离</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ciiKa%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uee796d85" id="uee796d85" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">的离策略 token。从 token 级视角来看，SAPO 提供一种平滑的降权机制；从序列级视角来看，SAPO 抑制序列中极端离策略 token 的梯度，从而构建更有效的训练序列。GRPO 和 GSPO 依赖硬裁剪，其在优化过程中的自适应性不及 SAPO</span></strong></p>